---
import Layout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
const lastmod = "2025-10-17T00:00:00Z";
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="Learn about how I handle your data and protect your privacy on this website."
  lastmod={lastmod}
>
  <main class="wrapper container mx-auto px-4 py-8 text-body">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-heading mb-4">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="mb-4">
      Your privacy is important to us. This Privacy Policy outlines how we
      handle your data when you use this website. By using the site, you consent
      to the practices described below.
    </p>

    <h2 class="">1. Information We Collect</h2>

    <h3>a. Automatically Collected Data</h3>
    <p>
      When you visit our website, certain information is automatically collected
      for operational and analytical purposes:
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <span>Analytics Data:</span> We use Google Analytics to collect anonymized
        information about your interactions with the site, including pages viewed,
        time spent, and other usage statistics.
      </li>
    </ul>

    <h3>b. Voluntarily Provided Data</h3>
    <p>
      If you contact us via email, we may collect the following information:
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <span>Email Address:</span> Provided by you when sending an email. This information
        will only be used to respond to your inquiry and will not be shared.
      </li>
      <li>
        <span>Message Content:</span> Any additional information you voluntarily
        include in your email.
      </li>
    </ul>

    <h2>2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>To monitor and improve the performance of the website.</li>
      <li>To respond to inquiries sent via email.</li>
      <li>To ensure the security and reliability of the website.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>3. Data Sharing</h2>
    <p>
      We do not share your personal information with third parties, except for
      the following:
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <span>Google Analytics:</span> Anonymized usage data is shared with Google
        for analytical purposes. You can review Google's privacy policies here:
        <a
          href="https://policies.google.com/privacy"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
        >
          Google Privacy Policy
        </a>.
      </li>
    </ul>

    <h2>4. Managing Your Data</h2>
    <p>
      You have the right to manage your data. For analytics, you can manage your
      cookie preferences using the link on the footer of the site. If you wish
      to delete or inquire about any data we may hold, please contact us at:
      <a href="mailto:artnikkila@gmail.com"> artnikkila@gmail.com</a>.
    </p>

    <h2>5. Data Retention</h2>
    <p>
      <ul>
        <li>
          Google Analytics Data: Retained according to Google's data retention
          policies.
        </li>
        <li>
          Email Data: Retained only as long as necessary to respond to
          inquiries.
        </li>
      </ul>
    </p>

    <h2>Cookies</h2>
    <p>
      This part explains how this website uses cookies to enhance your browsing
      experience. Cookies are small text files that are stored on your device
      when you visit a website. They are used to store information about your
      preferences and activity on the site.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-heading mt-6 mb-4">
      Types of Cookies We Use
    </h2>

    <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-heading mb-2">
      1. Necessary Cookies
    </h3>
    <p class="mb-4">
      Necessary cookies are essential for the functionality of the website.
      These cookies cannot be disabled in our cookie consent manager.
    </p>
    <ul class="list-disc list-inside mb-4">
      <li>
        <span class="font-semibold">consentStatus:</span> This cookie saves your
        cookie consent preferences. It is required for the cookie consent banner
        to function properly.
      </li>
    </ul>

    <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-heading mb-2">
      2. Analytics Cookies
    </h3>
    <p class="mb-4">
      Analytics cookies help us understand how visitors interact with our
      website by collecting and reporting anonymous data. These cookies are
      optional and are only enabled with your consent.
    </p>
    <ul class="list-disc list-inside mb-4">
      <li>
        <span class="font-semibold">_ga:</span> A Google Analytics cookie used to
        distinguish users and track their activity on the site.
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="font-semibold">_ga*:</span> A variation of the Google Analytics
        cookie used for the same purpose but may include additional properties.
      </li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-heading mt-6 mb-4">Managing Cookies</h2>
    <p class="mb-4">
      You can manage your cookie preferences at any time by pressing the link
      "Cookie Settings" on the site footer. From there, you can enable or
      disable specific categories of cookies according to your preferences.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-heading mt-6 mb-4">
      Third-Party Cookies
    </h2>
    <p class="mb-4">
      This website uses third-party services, such as Google Analytics, that may
      set their own cookies. These services have their own privacy policies and
      cookie policies that you can review for more information:
    </p>
    <ul class="list-disc list-inside mb-4">
      <li>
        <a
          href="https://policies.google.com/privacy"
          class="underline text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800 visited:text-purple-600"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
        >
          Google Analytics Privacy Policy
        </a>
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/cookies"
          class="underline text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800 visited:text-purple-600"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
        >
          Google Analytics Cookie Policy
        </a>
      </li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-heading mt-6 mb-4">
      6. Changes to This Privacy Policy
    </h2>

    <p class="mb-4">
      We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time to reflect changes in
      our practices or for legal reasons. Please revisit this page periodically
      to stay informed about how we handle your data.
    </p>

    <p class="text-sm mt-8 text-gray-600">
      Last updated: <span class="font-semibold">17.11.2025</span>
    </p>
  </main>
</Layout>
